title: "The six-dimensional point-transitive kissing number is 72"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Proves that the maximum size of a point-transitive kissing configuration in six dimensions is 72. Uses finite group actions and rigorously certified continuous orbit exclusions. No claim is made for unrestricted configurations."
